  "solution": "**Formula used**\n\n(a + b) = a² + b² + 2ab.\n\na⁸ - b⁸ = (a⁴ + b⁴)(a⁴ - b⁴)\n\n(a⁴ - b⁴) = (a² + b²)(a² - b²)\n\n**Calculation**\n\n⇒ x + 1/x = 3√2\n\n⇒ (x +1/x)² = 18\n\n⇒ x² + 1/x² + 2 = 18\n\n⇒ x² + 1/x² = 16\n\n⇒ (x² + 1/x²)² = 16²\n\n⇒ x⁴ + 1/x⁴ + 2 = 256\n\n⇒ x⁴ + 1/x⁴ = 254\n\n⇒ x4 + 1/x4 - 2 = 254 - 2\n\n⇒ (x2 - 1/x2)2 = 252\n\n⇒ x² - 1/x² = 6√7\n\n⇒ x8 - 1/x⁸ = (x4 + 1/x4)(x4 - 1/x4)\n\n⇒ x8 - 1/x8 = (x4 + 1/x4)(x² - 1/x²)(x² + 1/x²)\n\n= 254 × 16 × 6√7\n\n= 24384√7\n\n**The answer is ****24384√7**.",
